\"/wiki/%E5%86%B7%E5%91%A8%E5%85%AD\" title=\"冷周六\"><img alt=\"冷周六\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B7%E5%91%A8%E5%85%AD\" title=\"冷周六\">冷周六</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.8</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>岁月的书签</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：311604</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"5\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">嘶嘶</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"5\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3116/311604/冷周六-1技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3116/311604/冷周六-1技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3116/311604/冷周六-2技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3116/311604/冷周六-2技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3116/311604/冷周六-大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3116/311604/冷周六-大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3116/311604/冷周六-嘶嘶.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3116/311604/冷周六-嘶嘶 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3116/311604/冷周六-入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3116/311604/冷周六-入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“一件古老的东方神秘学造物，铸造于约两千年前。可能代表某种神秘学生物——有鳞片，威严狰狞，充满象征含义。让我们来听听含章鼎的建议……‘那可能是我的远亲，或者你们一家的远亲。’含章鼎有远亲吗？<br />“含章鼎帮我们解读了铭文：一场于五月在水边开展的祭祀——向深水投入作物，然后举行盛大的赛会，向诗人与江中的神女致以敬意。我们相信，那位诗人将同远古造物沟通的咒语记载在了诗集之中……<br />“小心——别拿开那个玻璃罩子。一小时前，当我念出诗句，这个面具诱发了一场小型雷阵雨。看起来，我对发音的模仿能力还不错。<br />“我的衣服？嗯，这就是我和我的兄弟姐妹穿成这样的理由——我们在尝试重现祭祀。这是公平表决的结果，7票赞成，2票反对。<br />“嘘，请退至安全距离——实验马上开始。”</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"311604\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311607.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d1/Belonging-311607.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">艾草束<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Mugwort Bouquet</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />1<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>有着浓烈香气的植物。在雨水丰沛、暑气蒸腾的仲夏，这样一束艾草能带来清新的空气。东方的节日里，家家户户将艾草与菖蒲悬于门前，用以驱邪护宅。<br />“我和我的兄弟姐妹们挺喜欢这束艾草，尤其是它的香气……什么，有人认为它能驱蛇？”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311608.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/81/Belonging-311608.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“其声琤琮”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Tinkling Jades</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>进则揖之，退则扬之，然后玉铿鸣也。<br />由玉璜、玉坠、龙形佩、玛瑙管、绿松石质珠等多件玉石器组成的佩玉。传说中，巫觋佩戴玉璜以事神，这或许能为受访者的神话解析课题提供帮助。<br />“它很重……”谈及这件饰品时，受访者正嚼着一种被称为“粽子”的，淋了蜂蜜的糯米甜食，“而且只要稍稍一动就会响！”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311609.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b1/Belonging-311609.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“雾縠”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Misty Gauze</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />10<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>巧夺天工的纱衣，其轻似雾，其薄如云。受访者身着此衣，举手投足间光华流转，如同身披一泓碧水。<br />“摸起来又凉又滑，我想会有人对这种织造工艺感兴趣。<i>触感像蛇一样！对，像蛇一样！”</i></div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%AB%E9%98%B3%E6%8A%9A%E5%BD%97%E6%AD%8C1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 巫阳抚彗歌1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%AB%E9%98%B3%E6%8A%9A%E5%BD%97%E6%AD%8C1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%AB%E9%98%B3%E6%8A%9A%E5%BD%97%E6%AD%8C1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%AB%E9%98%B3%E6%8A%9A%E5%BD%97%E6%AD%8C1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%AB%E9%98%B3%E6%8A%9A%E5%BD%97%E6%AD%8C1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%AB%E9%98%B3%E6%8A%9A%E5%BD%97%E6%AD%8C1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%AB%E9%98%B3%E6%8A%9A%E5%BD%97%E6%AD%8C1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E